ng_compatibility_breakages.html\r\n\r\nThanks, I will try to get some time in the week to fix this","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5246318926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5441054249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110700#issuecomment-5441054249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110700","id":5441054249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRE_mKQ","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T15:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T15:03:24Z","body":"@Skywolf285 hey can you test this PR if you have time?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5441054249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5442970600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110700#issuecomment-5442970600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110700","id":5442970600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRG0j6A","user":{"login":"Skywolf285","id":49045791,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MDQ1Nzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49045791?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285","html_url":"https://github.com/Skywolf285","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T17:44:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T17:44:53Z","body":"I already did! Mostly using it to sniff out other issues with lightmaps ;)\r\n\r\nHaven't encountered any (with this PR) issues, only two quirks that don't really affect the purpose of this PR (showing texel density):\r\n\r\n1. When changing the texel density (either on the mesh or the LightmapGI node) will the shown texel grid not match with what it will became once the lightmap is baked. Don't see a way around this unless we are going to re-create the lightmap's UV map every time the user does anything that affects it (changing texel density, adding meshes, changing Global Illumination modes .etc). Note that the size of the texels (and thus the density) is still correct so for estimating texel density across a scene it still serves its purpose. Just might catch some users off-guard.\r\n\r\n2. Baking with super-sampling causes the grid to no longer align with the lightmap. Not sure if this is a problem with this PR though or the supersamping implementation (and in case of the latter if it's intentional) but the \"problem\" scales with the Supersampling Factor (2x gives a half texel offset, 4x a quarter .etc). Interestingly does your PR correctly catch the quirk where a factor that isn't a power of 2 actually increases the texel density after baking. Again, won't affect showing the _density_ so it still serves its intended purpose. Is less pleasing though when it doesn't perfectly lines up :P\r\n\r\nI will leave it up to the maintainers/reviewers to judge if these quirks are worth fixing.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5442970600/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443615788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110700#issuecomment-5443615788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110700","id":5443615788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRHb8LA","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T18:37:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T18:38:00Z","body":"Hey, thanks for testing and taking your time\r\n\r\n1) I only notice that mismatch with old bakes. Baking the lightmap again should match the preview with the one calculated from the lightmap hint. But I will check if there is a mismatch there.\r\n\r\n2) I didn't try with supersampling. Will try","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443615788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444093492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110700#issuecomment-5444093492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110700","id":5444093492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRH5GNA","user":{"login":"Skywolf285","id":49045791,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MDQ1Nzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49045791?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285","html_url":"https://github.com/Skywolf285","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Skywolf285/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T19:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T19:17:59Z","body":"One small issue I just discovered is that when you (re)parent a node that doesn't have a lightmap baked yet it doesn't take the Texel Scale property of the relevant LightmapGI node into account until this property is modified (or you bake the lightmap). If the node already has a lightmap baked before reparenting then it won't take the Texel Scale property  of its new LightmapGI node into account at all until you rebake (and instead uses the one from its old LightmapGI node).\r\n\r\n\r\n>     1. I only notice that mismatch with old bakes. Baking the lightmap again should match the preview with the one calculated from the lightmap hint. But I will check if there is a mismatch there.\r\n\r\nThis is exactly what I was trying to say. It does match it after baking. Just pointing out that before baking the preview has no way of knowing what the exact UVs will be once the lightmap are baked. Which makes total sense and would require a complete overhaul to when the lightmap's atlas is generated. It might be worth noting somewhere that this is expected behavior though.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444093492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5648706868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110700#issuecomment-5648706868","issue_url":"https://a